de</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/449868002\">449868002</a></td><td>Rookt dagelijks tabak</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/428041000124106\">428041000124106</a></td><td>Rookt soms tabak</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/43381005\">43381005</a></td><td>Rookt passief tabak</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/8517006\">8517006</a></td><td>Rookte vroeger</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/405746006\">405746006</a></td><td>Niet-roker, maar rookgedrag in verleden onbekend</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/266919005\">266919005</a></td><td>Heeft nooit gerookt</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
